凶","video_desc":"一场意外穿越，让现代军事专家秦阳来到了战国时代的平行世界。他惊讶地发现，自己的娘子竟是一国之君——周王。秦阳凭借现代知识，自信满满地想要辅佐娘子造反夺权，却不知她早已是女帝。两人在宫廷中上演了一出充满误会与幽默的闹剧。面对樱花国的野心和内部的阴谋，秦阳展示了他的\"大杀器\"，誓要保卫国家。然而，他的行为却引发了周王的担忧。这对欢喜冤家能否携手度过难关，共创盛世？","series_id":"7432186264675175486","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106235801A8FB3183BC565195CB5F\",\"rank\":\"6\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7432186264675175486\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.03732689097523689,\\\"like\\\":0.047425877302885056,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.1592868566513062,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10874496400356293,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.6886329650878906,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.0590507909655571,\\\"finish\\\":0.0028009277302771807}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7432186264675175486","play_cnt":29660,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"落尘互娱","sub_title":"古装·奇幻脑洞","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":56,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5007,\"name\":\"古装\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5007&categoryName=古装&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5074,\"name\":\"奇幻脑洞\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5074&categoryName=奇幻脑洞&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5123,\"name\":\"穿越\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5123&categoryName=穿越&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5165,\"name\":\"隐藏大佬\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5165&categoryName=隐藏大佬&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5155,\"name\":\"权臣篡位\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5155&categoryName=权臣篡位&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5119,\"name\":\"轻松搞笑\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5119&categoryName=轻松搞笑&genreType=130&gender=1&source=deta